    "content" : "Some things don&#39;t work out as you expect... I took my (what I thought was) finished automatic closet door light home last week to install and I couldn&#39;t get it working. Since I was away from school I didn&#39;t have all my tools that I needed to troubleshoot the problem. I was able to rig up a light switch, so that at least makes the light usable now. It&#39;s not automatic yet, but it will be soon!",
    "objectType" : "note",
